# M172 (DIR-108): plugin/vendor/quay/dist/quay.js used to be a NEGATED (tracked)
# exception to the bare `dist/` rule above (see git history at M120/DIR-060 for
# the old negation). It is now a genuinely generated artifact like every other
# dist/ — built by plugin/scripts/sync-vendor.sh (wired into the root
# `postinstall` script, so a fresh clone + `npm install` regenerates it with no
# manual step) for local dev, and published by
# .github/workflows/publish-plugin-dist.yml to the `dist-plugin` orphan branch
# for external `/plugin install` (marketplace.json's plugin source points
# there, not at `./plugin`). No negation needed anymore; the bare `dist/` rule
# above covers it like every other build output in this repo.
