# runtime state — must never appear in `git status --porcelain` (same family as gate-events.jsonl).
**/.quay/session-liveness.*.json
# gap-node-compile-cache-is-never-enabled-and-every-spawn-reparses (2026-08-04): the Node compile
# cache (NODE_COMPILE_CACHE) — same gitignored runtime-state family as gate-events.jsonl (DoD:
# "与 gate-events.jsonl 同形"). On DISK by construction: scripts/test.sh pins it to
# .quay/node-compile-cache (never $TMPDIR/tmpfs — the OOM family). A pure speedup: if absent, node
# just runs uncached. Must stay untracked or the suite-after dirty check fails.
**/.quay/node-compile-cache/
**/.quay/heavy-op-token-events.jsonl
**/.quay/prepare-leases/
