**/.quay/full-suite-state.json
**/.quay/full-suite.log
**/.quay/suite-state-events.jsonl
**/.quay/suite-state-last.json
# gap-resource-gate-no-single-flight-lock-two-suite-overlap: the single-flight lock FALLBACK path
# (<repo_root>/.quay/full-suite.lock) used only when git-common-dir is unavailable (a non-git copy).
# The PRIMARY path is <git-common-dir>/full-suite.lock (inside .git/, invisible to git status). The
# file must PERSIST (never unlink a flock'd file — classic flock+unlink race), so ignore it.
**/.quay/full-suite.lock
# gap-single-file-test-duration-trend-unwatched (AC1): the append-only per-file duration history
